  "id": "culture-free-test",
  "term": "culture-free test",
  "definition": "A culture-free test is a laboratory method that identifies pathogens directly from a clinical sample without first growing them in culture. In the source, it refers to metagenomic next-generation sequencing used to broadly detect microbes and resistance genes from samples.",
